                                "sense_id": "f443708a-3f45-3d20-ad9c-1303d73f2cc9",
                                "text": "The fauconer then was prest,\nCame runnynge with a dow,\nAnd cryed, ‘Stow, stow, stow!’\nBut she [his hawk] wold not bow."
